
Bates Motel
-----------

Again, no docs supplied with the door, however, some good ID text in the
executable reveals:

---

                   A D V E N T U R E

Converted to Metro Amiga by Prince Desty AKA: The Wraith

Original Version was done by an Unknown Author on an IBM.

Welcome to the Bates Motel Online Adventure.

The object of this game is to find a secret code, which is carved upon
two items.  When found, then you can seek out MOM, and kill her.  Be
warned:  There are more than two items.  If you use the wrong two codes,
you most likely will die.  At the end, a hint will be given which should
help you.  This is not a very easy adventure.  There are probably close
to 100 sections which you may go to.  The game is correct however, in
that if you enter a room then go back, you will be where you started.

---

I have seen one or two users actually solve this adventure.  When you
get a strange message from someone telling you what the code is, you
know they've solved it.  It's only text-based, but pretty intriguing if
you like text-based adventures in the classic style.

[PFD 23-Nov-94]

